      "content": "I recommend prioritizing Zip 90502, Zip 90771, and Zip 90990 for community center funding. These three zip codes exhibit the lowest median incomes and the highest crime rates, indicating areas with the most significant need for social support infrastructure. Investing here will directly address socioeconomic disparities and community safety concerns, leading to the greatest potential for long-term positive impact.",
